WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.725 --> 00:00:14.450
Watchlists live in the rail on every page.

2
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:28.876
A new list, "Tech". Add stocks from search: + or Shift+Enter.

3
00:00:28.876 --> 00:00:33.474
Live prices on every row, with ▲ ▼ and the day change.

4
00:00:33.474 --> 00:00:37.361
Drag a row by its handle to reorder.

5
00:00:37.361 --> 00:00:43.505
Or with the keyboard: Alt+↑ and Alt+↓ on a focused row.

6
00:00:43.505 --> 00:00:51.654
Sort by name, price or change; the saved order comes back with Custom.

7
00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:56.206
Remove from the row. Lists, order and sort survive a reload.

8
00:00:56.206 --> 00:00:58.779
Several lists per account, each switchable from the tabs.
